18	 * {@link SaveOwner}, so the not-yet-saved owner is not compared against itself. The full-identity
19	 * duplicate check ({@link CheckOwnerIdentityUnique}) is separate and still applies to a declared
20	 * member, so a member repeating another member's whole identityKey is still a 409.
21	 */
22	public class CheckHouseholdUnique {
23	
24	    public void service(@Val Owner owner, @Val OwnerFieldsDto request, OwnerRepository ownerRepository)
25	            throws OwnerHouseholdConflictException {
